    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_proj", "x": 1356, "y": 658, "width": 840, "height": 240,
      "text": "page weight  =  318 KB fixed  +  277 B × cases\n\n     118 cases   pretest, today      →    350 KB\n   1,521 cases   F1 complete          →    740 KB\n   5,000 cases                        →    1.7 MB\n  20,000 cases   full rollout         →    5.8 MB   ← the wall\n\n  with plan externalised + columnar rows (≈90 B/case):\n  20,000 cases                        →    1.9 MB",
      "originalText": "page weight  =  318 KB fixed  +  277 B × cases\n\n     118 cases   pretest, today      →    350 KB\n   1,521 cases   F1 complete          →    740 KB\n   5,000 cases                        →    1.7 MB\n  20,000 cases   full rollout         →    5.8 MB   ← the wall\n\n  with plan externalised + columnar rows (≈90 B/case):\n  20,000 cases                        →    1.9 MB",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
