      "text": "✓  matches Tableau / Power BI convention\n✗  saves nothing unless the data is split too\n✗  4× generator work, 4 URLs to keep in sync\n✗  filter state must thread across pages\n✗  breaks one-screenshot-for-a-deck\n○  right shape only if D is adopted with it",
