    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_d_bul", "x": 1710, "y": 1364, "width": 500, "height": 150,
      "text": "✓  the only option that removes the linear term\n✓  page weight flat at any survey size\n✗  biggest build — a service, not a generator\n✗  breaks \"static file behind Apache auth\"\n✗  new failure mode during live fieldwork\n○  revisit at rollout, once F2 API patterns settle",
      "originalText": "✓  the only option that removes the linear term\n✓  page weight flat at any survey size\n✗  biggest build — a service, not a generator\n✗  breaks \"static file behind Apache auth\"\n✗  new failure mode during live fieldwork\n○  revisit at rollout, once F2 API patterns settle",
